    "## Teacher (T)\n",
    "\n",
    "T is loaded as the unpruned specialist and used as the reference model for\n",
    "baseline evaluation and knowledge distillation. The distillation routine\n",
    "handles teacher freezing internally; this notebook does not modify T's\n",
    "parameters before pruning copies are created.\n",
    "\n",
    "`assert_tied` confirms that T's input embeddings and `lm_head` share one\n",
    "tensor. Every pruned copy inherits that sharing, and the notebook checks it\n",
    "again after each pruning stage and after distillation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "03f1ba50",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "03f1ba50"
